WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.049 --> 00:00:07.049
Charter school authorizing is important.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:14.580
It helps ensure that charter schools are responsible stewards of their students and of public funds. Good authorizers don't give license to mediocrity,

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:19.859
but they must also protect the autonomy that enables vibrant schools to flourish. As NASCA

00:00:19.859 --> 00:00:26.609
president Greg Richmond has observed: "In both the red and blue states last year, we saw legislation proposed that would have dictated

00:00:26.609 --> 00:00:32.040
what a charter school should be, rather than what outcomes taxpayers should hold it accountable for

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.780
These bills required certain curriculum certain discipline models and certain teacher principal and staff

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:46.360
certification requirements. Look the easiest thing in the world is to insist on just one more rule that charter schools should follow.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:52.460
But the accretion of rules over time creates a sclerosis that leaves school stuck and

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:56.420
educators frustrated. If charter schools are to deliver on their promise

00:00:56.920 --> 00:01:03.560
Authorizers must help ensure that educators can create terrific classrooms and not simply to recreate

00:01:03.720 --> 00:01:05.720
familiar, hidebound bureaucracies.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.020
What do you think about charter schools?

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.340
Let us know in our poll. Also,

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:17.540
let us know what other topics you'd like our scholars to cover in 60 seconds, and be sure to LIKE and subscribe

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:21.140
